menu "XPRS LoRa"

config XPRS_LORA
    bool "LoRa radio code (the SX1262 bearer, Meshtastic and MeshCore)"
    default y
    help
        Off on a board with no LoRa radio: the bearer is built as stubs
        (xprslora_stub.c) and the SX1262, Meshtastic and MeshCore code is
        not linked, about 44 KB of flash on the e-paper board.

endmenu
